deal, and you had, like,

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:23.554
huge scaling challenges
because it's like on Nintendo.

00:03:23.554 --> 00:03:24.470
MARK MANDEL: Nintendo.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:24.810
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:25.200
MARK MANDEL: Mario.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.200
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Like
